    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_ANOINTED_CHAMPION_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: one combat unit of yours that is not a hero or a summon gains the Hero promotion and the experience for two more promotions.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]In a battle a hero has one more action in its best row; a unit of tier 4 or above has it already and gains no second one.",
